{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0luZGlhbl9CYW5nbGEvMjAyMC0tQmVmb3JlL1R1c2tpJTIwQmVuZ2FsaSUyMCUyODIwMTglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Tuski Bengali","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/yZec5FxjcNmyKvMsb7Vr3NsWz5r.jpg","description":"A slice-of-life drama about a bright, little girl Tuski who comes from a humble background, and wishes to attend a school where only the rich are allowed. This is a story of the disparity between two girl child from rich and poor section of the society. Tuski, a poor girl was born unsung and lives in a family in a slum. She lost her mother just after her birth and was raised by her aunt Ranita. Tuski's father Subrata is an auto-rickshaw driver. For them struggle for survival is more valid than raising issues on morality. Ranita works as a household maid in the family of Tua, another child of Tuski’s age who lives in a highrise beside the slum. While Tua and Tuski get friendly Tua’s mother become over conscious about the difference of their social status.\n\nReleased 24 Aug 2018 · India · Language: Bengali · 111 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Bengali (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Bengali"],"imdb_id":"tt8908008","moviedb_id":1020530,"tmdbId":1020530,"runtime":"111 min","cast":["Kharaj Mukherjee","Kanchana Moitra","Rajesh Sharma","Rana Chakraborty","Priyanka Dutta"],"director":["Aniket Chattopadhyay"],"released":"2018-08-24T00:00:00.000Z","country":"India","language":"Bengali","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Aniket Chattopadhyay","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4udcx82RapxS5vsBVqq9msXqTnf.jpg"},{"name":"Kharaj Mukherjee","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gvRKdSuaVHY33NFSgGWNVTzLyWU.jpg"},{"name":"Kanchana Moitra","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/88qgF3xqt9aSDJZXIOOagVvGv1J.jpg"},{"name":"Rajesh Sharma","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cBmZY1EICMD1q16Fx7GqpHkc6A1.jpg"},{"name":"Rana Chakraborty","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/